# ====================================================
# MICROSERVICES & CACHE TRIMMING (CRITICAL FOR YOUR TREE)
# ====================================================

# 1. Python Cache & Linting Metadata
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/__pycache__/
**/.mypy_cache/

# 2. Local Virtual Environments (If any service has its own venv)
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/env/

# 3. Frontend Build Outputs (inside frontend/event-management-ui)
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/.cache/

# 4. Universal Node & Package Trimming
**/node_modules/
**/package-lock.json
